      "source": "Note that this resolver will either resolve the version from the specified\npath segment, or raise an <a href=\"../../accept/InvalidApiVersionException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.accept\"><code>InvalidApiVersionException</code></a>, e.g. if there\nare not enough path segments. It never returns <code>null</code>, and therefore\ncannot yield to other resolvers.",
